 "description": "The MDTU P-384 module is a Suite B cryptographic storage device featuring XTS-AES 256-bit full disk encryption and P-384 based digital signature services. The device is fully adapted for the storage and protection of sensitive data assets and provides an automated secure data exchange service with external devices by way of a high strength authentication mechanism. The physical security and capabilities of this module make it ideal for secure transfer of essential assets in mission-critical applications.",
